#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Test Script for Phase 5: Execution Layer

Tests:
1. Risk Engine
2. Execution Engine
3. Order Placement and Fills
4. Position Management
5. Stop Loss / Take Profit

Run this after Phase 4 tests pass.
